  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "a949c61c",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## RAAS changes across tissues — by disease and by substitution subtype\n",
    "\n",
    "Median-RAAS heatmaps and substitution-subtype tests of how RAAS shifts with disease in each tissue. Unless noted, RAAS is summarized as the **median over replicates per unique SAAP**, then the **median of those SAAP medians per substitution type (AAS)**, requiring ≥ `min_saap_per_aas` qualifying SAAPs. Fold change is log2(median RAAS / tissue-specific CTRL). With `COMPLETE_SAAPS_ONLY`, each cohort keeps only SAAPs detected in every disease state. Heatmap columns are always ordered ACG (b1–5) then FC (b2–5); x labels show the disease descriptor only."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 184,
   "id": "cedb3943",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
