    "    'top15_substitution_ReporterRAAS_Disease_tissue_heatmap_acg.pdf', figsize=(20, 10))\n",
    "plot_raas_tissue_disease_heatmap(\n",
    "    SAAP_quant_df_fc, 'Median RAAS per Tissue Across Disease States for Top 15 AAS',\n",
    "    'top15_substitution_ReporterRAAS_Disease_tissue_heatmap_fc.pdf', figsize=(20, 10))\n"
   ]
  },
