    "# 4. Changes associated with disease\n",
    "\n",
    "Per-cohort (ACG, FC, pooled Brain) disease-vs-CTRL RAAS analysis. **SAAP-level:** Welch's t-test of log10(RAAS) for each disease vs CTRL per unique SAAP (≥ `min_reps` replicates per group), BH-FDR per comparison; significant SAAPs shown as per-disease mean log2(RAAS/CTRL) heatmaps and volcanoes. **Substitution-level:** the same test aggregated per substitution type (volcano + CTRL-vs-disease RAAS scatter for the top hit). With `COMPLETE_SAAPS_ONLY`, each cohort uses only SAAPs seen in all of its disease states. Stats are computed once in 4a and cached in `COHORTS` for 4b/4c.\n",
    "\n",
    "Blocks: **4a** significance heatmaps; **4b** per-disease SAAP & substitution volcanoes; **4c** top-substitution CTRL-vs-disease scatter; **4d** most-changed SAAP per disease; **4e** global substitution volcano (all disease pooled vs CTRL); **4f** per-SAAP log2(RAAS/CTRL) fold-change distributions; **4g** substitutions with significantly elevated RAAS in a tissue (tissue vs other tissue)."
