   ],
   "source": [
    "# 4g. Significant SAAPs — RAAS by disease (Brain cohort; grouped tissues, individual-SAAP level).\n",
    "# The SAAPs flagged significant in the 4a heatmap (sig_stats, same rule), each shown as its own\n",
    "# row split by disease state (CTRL/AD/PD/ADPD) rather than by tissue. Left: per-replicate log10\n",
    "# RAAS boxplots colored by disease; right: per-disease SAAP-observation counts. Rows are ordered\n",
    "# exactly like the 4a heatmap (descending mean disease log2(RAAS/CTRL)).\n",
    "def plot_significant_saap_by_disease(cohort):\n",
    "    cohort_df, name, neuro = cohort['df'], cohort['name'], cohort['neuro']\n",
    "    sig_all = cohort['sig_stats']\n",
    "    if sig_all is None or sig_all.empty:\n",
    "        print(f'[{name}] no significant SAAPs to plot.'); return\n",
    "    sig_saaps = sig_all['SAAP'].unique().tolist()\n",
    "    df = cohort_df.copy()\n",
    "    df['SAAP'] = df['aa_sub'] + ' | ' + df['MTP_seq']\n",
    "    df = df[df['SAAP'].isin(sig_saaps)]\n",
    "    diseases = [d for d in disease_order if d in df['Disease'].unique()]   # canonical, incl CTRL\n",
    "    # order rows exactly like the 4a heatmap: mean disease log2(RAAS/CTRL) descending\n",
    "    norm = normalize_logfc(cohort_df); norm['SAAP'] = norm['aa_sub'] + ' | ' + norm['MTP_seq']\n",
    "    matrix = (norm[norm['SAAP'].isin(sig_saaps)]\n",
    "              .pivot_table(index='SAAP', columns='Disease', values='log2FC', aggfunc='mean')\n",
    "              .reindex(columns=disease_order))\n",
    "    order = matrix[neuro].mean(axis=1).sort_values(ascending=False).index.tolist()\n",
    "    counts = df.groupby(['SAAP', 'Disease'], observed=True).size().reset_index(name='N')\n",
    "\n",
    "    fig, axes = plt.subplots(1, 2, figsize=(8, max(5, 0.32 * len(order))),\n",
    "                             gridspec_kw={'width_ratios': [3, 1]}, sharey=True)\n",
    "    plt.subplots_adjust(wspace=0.02)\n",
    "    sns.boxplot(data=df, y='SAAP', x='log10_RAAS', hue='Disease', order=order, hue_order=diseases,\n",
    "                palette=DISEASE_COLORS, fliersize=0.5, linewidth=0.8, ax=axes[0])\n",
    "    for patch in axes[0].patches:\n",
    "        patch.set_alpha(0.85)\n",
    "    axes[0].set_xlabel(r'log$_{10}$(RAAS)', fontsize=14); axes[0].set_ylabel('')\n",
    "    axes[0].tick_params('both', labelsize=7 if len(order) > 25 else 9)\n",
    "    axes[0].legend(frameon=False, fontsize=LEGEND_SIZE, loc='lower right',\n",
    "                   title='Disease', title_fontsize=LEGEND_SIZE)\n",
    "    sns.barplot(data=counts, y='SAAP', x='N', hue='Disease', order=order, hue_order=diseases,\n",
    "                palette=DISEASE_COLORS, ax=axes[1])\n",
    "    axes[1].set_xscale('log'); axes[1].set_xlabel('# SAAP obs.', fontsize=14); axes[1].set_ylabel('')\n",
    "    legend = axes[1].get_legend()\n",
    "    if legend is not None:\n",
    "        legend.remove()\n",
    "    axes[1].tick_params('both', labelsize=8)\n",
    "    despine(axes[0]); despine(axes[1])\n",
    "    fig.suptitle(f'{name}: significant SAAPs — RAAS by disease', fontsize=TITLE_SIZE)\n",
    "    fig.savefig(f'{PLOT_DIR}SAAP_significant_RAAS_by_disease_{name}.pdf', bbox_inches='tight')\n",
    "    plt.show()\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "plot_significant_saap_by_disease(COHORTS['Brain'])\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "sharedpepmd",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Shared-peptide RAAS in protein context (exploratory)\n",
    "\n",
    "**Shared peptides** = tryptic peptides found in *both* the encoded (BP) and alternatively-translated\n",
    "(SAAP) proteoforms of a protein — i.e. the protein's other detected peptides besides the substituted\n",
    "one. Plotting their abundance along the protein, with the SAAP and BP at the substitution site, places\n",
    "the substitution in the context of the whole protein's expression (RAAS = SAAP / BP).\n",
    "\n",
    "Pipeline (cells below):\n",
    "1. **Reference proteome + helpers** — parse `HUMAN.fasta` (the BLAST DB) into `accession → sequence`.\n",
    "2. **Assemble `Plotted_shared_peptide_data.xlsx`** — per detected SAAP: its source protein (BLASTp),\n",
    "   the full protein sequence, and every other MaxQuant-detected peptide of that protein\n",
    "   (\"shared peptides\") with its intensity (`peptides.txt`); SAAP/BP precursor abundances and RAAS\n",
    "   come from `SAAP_quant_df`.\n",
    "3. **`plot_shared_peptides(df, gene)`** — peptide abundance vs amino-acid position."
   ]
