    "# ── Pick a protein and plot ───────────────────────────────────────────────────\n",
    "# Set GENE_TO_PLOT to a gene symbol (e.g. 'FBP1;FBP'). Leave it None to auto-pick the\n",
    "# substitution with the highest RAAS (SAAP/BP). Genes with more shared peptides plot most clearly.\n",
