    "## Reference-protein RAAS ranking (exploratory)\n",
    "\n",
    "Rank each **source protein** by the median RAAS of the SAAPs mapping to it (BLASTp), to see which\n",
    "proteins carry the strongest substitution signal. The core table below (`Reference protein`, `SAAPs`,\n",
    "`Median RAAS`, `N SAAP`, `Rank`, `Genes`) is computed directly from the BLASTp source-protein map +\n",
    "per-SAAP RAAS. **`GO terms` / `Pathway group` / `is TF`** are added *separately* from a protein-set\n",
    "enrichment analysis (GSEA / MSigDB GO), manual pathway-group curation, and a TF list — left blank\n",
    "here until those resources are provided, so the plot starts all-gray and the colors activate once\n",
    "`Pathway group` is filled in."
   ]
