     "text": [
      "254 reference proteins ranked -> /Users/alexmaropakis/Projects/BrainDecode/Dependencies/Analysis_Outputs/Ping_2018/Reference_proteins_ranked_Median_RAAS.xlsx\n",
      "  (funnel: 476 unique SAAPs -> 448 with a BLASTp source protein -> 419 SAAP-protein rows with RAAS -> 254 unique proteins)\n",
      "                                                                                          Reference protein  Median RAAS  N SAAP      Genes\n",
      "0                 tr|K7ES63|K7ES63_HUMAN Tubulin beta-6 chain (Fragment) OS=Homo sapiens GN=TUBB6 PE=1 SV=1     2.315423       1    [TUBB6]\n",
